  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "start": 0.05,
      "end": 0.986,
      "text": "A mirror for heat.",
      "words": 4,
      "words_per_s": 4.27,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 20.8
    },
    {
      "id": "l02",
      "start": 1.2,
      "end": 4.737,
      "text": "That's the shiny wall inside a thermos. Why does it need one?",
      "words": 12,
      "words_per_s": 3.39,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 16.4
    },
    {
      "id": "l03",
      "start": 5.0,
      "end": 9.192,
      "text": "Heat escapes three ways: through solids, through air, and as infrared light.",
      "words": 12,
      "words_per_s": 2.86,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 17.0
    },
    {
      "id": "l04",
      "start": 9.45,
      "end": 12.095,
      "text": "A thermos has two walls with a vacuum between them.",
      "words": 10,
      "words_per_s": 3.78,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 18.9
    },
    {
      "id": "l05",
      "start": 12.35,
      "end": 16.196,
      "text": "With almost no air there, heat can barely conduct or flow across.",
      "words": 12,
      "words_per_s": 3.12,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 17.6
    },
    {
      "id": "l06",
      "start": 16.45,
      "end": 19.838,
      "text": "But infrared crosses a vacuum, like sunlight through space.",
      "words": 9,
      "words_per_s": 2.66,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 17.2
    },
    {
      "id": "l07",
      "start": 20.1,
      "end": 22.312,
      "text": "So the walls are shiny, bouncing it back.",
      "words": 8,
      "words_per_s": 3.62,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 15.9
    },
    {
      "id": "l08",
      "start": 22.6,
      "end": 25.744,
      "text": "That leaves the top as the weak spot, so keep the lid on.",
      "words": 13,
      "words_per_s": 4.13,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 17.2
    },
    {
      "id": "l09",
      "start": 26.45,
      "end": 29.733,
      "text": "Download Recall to turn your study material into lessons.",
      "words": 9,
      "words_per_s": 2.74,
      "voice_over_bed_db": 17.6
    }
  ],
